    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12827" root="دقع" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَقُوعُ اليَدَيْنِ</span></b>  A camel <i>that throws forth his fore
legs, and scrapes the dust,</i> or <i>earth,</i> (K, TA,)
<i>when he goes the pace,</i> or <i>at the rate,</i> or <i>in the
manner, termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَبَب</span>. (TA.)

